  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO - Improvement of Protection of Relief Personnel and Improved Effectiveness of Humanitarian Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INSO provide Humanitarian organisations in Mozambique access to timely, reliable, and high-quality safety services that help them plan, operate, and deliver aid more safely. This includes (1) information, analysis and advice; and (2) security management, preparedness and capacity development.</narrative>
  </description>
